Message:
Administrative Assistant (WhatsApp Sandy#55919352申請)

 *_Responsibilities:_*
 * Responsible for general office administration duties and clerical support;
 * Responsible for procurement of office supplies, electronic devices and professional services;
 * Liaise with external service providers;
 * Assist in preparing the annual budget for Office Administration Team;
 * Assist in scheduling and coordinating meetings and minutes taking
 * Back up the receptionist (if required);
 *_Requirements:_*
 * Degree holder in Business Administration or related discipline(s);
 * 1-2 years of relevant experience in sizable companies is preferred; fresh graduates are welcome;
 * With strong sense of responsibility; Well organized and detail oriented;
 * Full of team spirit, good interpersonal and communication skills;
 * Good command of written and spoken English and Putonghua;
 * Proficient in MS office Word, Excel, PowerPoint and Chinese Word Processing;
 * Immediate available will be an advantage
 Date: Mondays – Fridays
 Time: 09:00 – 18:00
 Location: Central
 Salary: Negotiable

Responsibilities: 

 Assist with daily operations of the cruise terminal;

 Assist in leading and managing part-time staff;

 Offer assistance and services to tourists;

 Responsible for maintaining order and crowd management at the cruise terminal;

 Provide various concierge services;

 General clerical work, including data entry, assisting in writing reports, etc.



 Requirements: 

 Good command of both written and spoken English, Chinese and Putonghua;

 Proficiently in Microsoft Office;

 Minimum 2 year of work experience in customer service, hospitality and travel industry;

 DSE or above;

 Immediate available is highly preferred



 Working Hours: 6 - 12 hours per day; 5 days per week; shift duties: 06:00 - 22:00 (depending on actual ship calls)

 Hourly Rate: HK$93


 We offer attractive remuneration package, medical and insurance benefits, annual leave and provident fund. Please respond in complete confidence with a cover letter, detailed resume, current and expected salary by e-mail.
